  m_text: "Hareket\nBak\u0131\u015F ve vuru\u015F y\xF6n\xFC\nBalta savurma (bas\u0131l\u0131 tut: s\xFCrekli)\nAt\u0131lma (H\u0131z 5'te a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r)\nKalkan (Sa\u011Fl\u0131k 5'te a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, ma\xE7ta 1 kez)\nUlti (G\xFC\xE7 5'te a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, ma\xE7ta 1 kez)\nG\xFC\xE7 / H\u0131z / Sa\u011Fl\u0131k geli\u015Ftirmesini \xFCret\nCan iksiri \xFCret\nEnvanter panelini a\xE7 / kapat\nDuraklat"
