--- !u!114 &720932849
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 720932847}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8a764ce0fa8244ecf9138089fa5976f5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LeafBrawl.Presentation.MainMenuView
  actions: {fileID: -944628639613478452, guid: a49acbbe0bd854667b1f3817d3244c62, type: 3}
  mainPanel: {fileID: 253892853}
  startButton: {fileID: 1177476369}
  guideButton: {fileID: 2136070273}
  controlsButton: {fileID: 445261194}
  quitButton: {fileID: 1038091371}
  controlsPanel: {fileID: 1957990706}
  controlsBackButton: {fileID: 292070484}
  guidePanel: {fileID: 1518954105}
  guideTitle: {fileID: 1953412988}
  guideBody: {fileID: 1621274107}
  guidePageLabel: {fileID: 1618593290}
  guideImage: {fileID: 1656458117}
  guidePrevButton: {fileID: 1520012111}
  guideNextButton: {fileID: 1955910083}
  guideBackButton: {fileID: 1765616836}
  pages:
  - title: "1. Yaprak toplama ve a\u011Fa\xE7 kesme"
    body: "Yerdeki yapra\u011F\u0131n \xFCst\xFCnden ge\xE7ince otomatik toplan\u0131r. A\u011Fa\xE7lar zamanla yaprak d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCr; baltayla (sol t\u0131k veya L) keserek 6\u201310 yaprak birden al\u0131rs\u0131n. Ortadaki ulu a\u011Fa\xE7 kesilmez ama en \xE7ok yapra\u011F\u0131 o d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCr."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29cde12549bbb49f09dba6be9b76ebf3, type: 3}
  - title: "2. Tarifler, seviyeler ve g\xFCvende kural\u0131"
    body: "G\xFC\xE7, H\u0131z ve Sa\u011Fl\u0131k 1. seviyeden ba\u015Flar, en fazla 5'e \xE7\u0131kar; 1, 2 ve 3 tu\u015Flar\u0131yla yaprak harcay\u0131p bir seviye y\xFCkseltirsin. Her seviye bir \xF6ncekinden daha \xE7ok yaprak ister. Tarif yaln\u0131zca g\xFCvendeyken \xFCretilir: alan\u0131n i\xE7inde ol, son 3 saniyede hasar alma ve balta savurma."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7d7b8d2d293b24deca0b356bd6b14f0c, type: 3}
  - title: 3. Can yenilenmesi ve can iksiri
    body: "5 saniye hasar almazsan can\u0131n yava\u015F yava\u015F dolar; Sa\u011Fl\u0131k seviyen artt\u0131k\xE7a daha h\u0131zl\u0131 dolar. 4 tu\u015Fuyla 2 ye\u015Fil ve 1 turuncu yapraktan can iksiri yapars\u0131n. \u0130ksir hemen i\xE7ilir ve can\u0131n\u0131 40 art\u0131r\u0131r."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 13a0d2ef7bbf249d9ae0d5bd713e399c, type: 3}
  - title: 4. 5. seviye yetenekleri
    body: "H\u0131z 5'te Bo\u015Fluk ile k\u0131sa bir at\u0131lma yapars\u0131n, 3 saniyede bir kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Sa\u011Fl\u0131k 5'te Q ile ma\xE7ta bir kez kalkan a\xE7ars\u0131n; 6 saniye boyunca gelen ilk vuru\u015Fu emer. G\xFC\xE7 5'te E ile ma\xE7ta bir kez ulti yapars\u0131n; yak\u0131n\u0131ndaki b\xFCt\xFCn rakipler elenir."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 47d97e10e393045e993d6297bf616d08, type: 3}
  - title: "5. \xC7al\u0131l\u0131klar"
    body: "\xC7al\u0131l\u0131\u011Fa giren karakter, ayn\u0131 \xE7al\u0131l\u0131kta olmayan herkese g\xF6r\xFCnmez olur. \xC7al\u0131l\u0131ktayken balta savurursan ya da hasar al\u0131rsan 1 saniye boyunca g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCrs\xFCn. Ka\xE7arken ya da pusu kurarken \xE7al\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131 kullan."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2b70777cfa15549c78393b63783579b2, type: 3}
  - title: 6. Daralan alan ve elenme
    body: "G\xFCvenli alan 1:30'dan sonra merkeze do\u011Fru daral\u0131r; d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda kalan her saniye hasar al\u0131r. \xD6len karakter yeniden do\u011Fmaz; son kalan kazan\u0131r. 5:00'te alan tamamen kapan\u0131r ve ma\xE7 birka\xE7 saniye i\xE7inde biter."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 229cf4f2ef1be4834bd8999bcbeeac0a, type: 3}
